2.(1) There shall be established an Institute which shallbe called the National Institute of Fisheries and NauticalEngineering (hereinafter referred to as the “Institute”).

(2) The Institute shall, by the name assigned to it by sub-section (1), be a body corporate with perpetual successionand a common seal and may sue and be sued in such name.

