3. The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be-

(a) to foster and promote education by establishing andmaintaining “Mahanuwara Bauddha Vidya Peetaya”,Pirivena training institutes of bhikkus, schools, andEducational institutions and by granting scholarships;

