(7) to accept that the means by which the objects of the Associationare to be achieved should be honest and pure ;

(8) to accept and abide by the decisions of the Executive Counciland the Elders Council in matters pertaining to membership ofthe Association and to pledge that the only step that suchmember shall take is to voluntarily resign, if the said Councildecides to remove such member from membership ;

